      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In Episode 4 of Paquita Salas, Madrid talent agent Paquita tries to pitch her new client Mariona over the phone as the next Carmen Machi. Speaking to the camera, she explains that a newcomer at PS Management needs two things, faith and good headshots, before admitting that Mariona's smile looks like sheer terror. Listen to the Spanish first, then we'll go through each line.",
      "gap": 0.8
